err.app.jobExists = a job named "{job}" already exists
err.app.alreadyRunning = job "{job}" is already running
err.app.renameRunning = job "{job}" is running; it cannot be renamed now
err.app.deleteRunning = job "{job}" is running; it cannot be deleted now
err.app.elevatedExit = the command run with administrator rights failed (exit code {code})
err.app.pathOutside = file is not in the log folder: {path}
err.app.keepDays = log retention cannot be negative
err.app.theme = unknown theme: {theme}
warn.app.renamedTask = the scheduled task of the old name ({path}) still runs the old job and will fail; delete it and create the task again
warn.app.renamedBatch = the batch file of the old name ({path}) still runs the old job
warn.app.taskOutdated = the scheduled task ({path}) does not match the saved settings; update the task

