gui.archive.retentionInfo = Only files matching this job's file name template are deleted; the backup date is read from the file name. Two jobs using the same folder, template and database share the same files.
gui.archive.accessWarning = ZIP and retention work on files directly, so this program (and the scheduled task account) needs read, write and delete access to the access path. Use "Check access" on the Backup tab.

